184 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 93 0 R
/E (This project encompasses the complete cycle from material selection and design to the fabrication and testing of a functional prototype. The scope includes creating detailed design drawings, sourcing the necessary materials, manufacturing the table, and evaluating its performance. The final product is intended for use in homes, hostels, and offices for light-duty tasks such as using a laptop, writing, or reading. The design is specifically focused on simplicity and cost-effectiveness without compromising on its core function.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
