/P 94 0 R
/E (Our proposed product addresses these limitations by using WPVC material. The design incorporates a simple foldable leg mechanism, ensuring the table can be folded flat in seconds. This makes it exceptionally easy to store under a bed, behind a door, or in a cupboard. The use of WPVC provides a robust, water-proof, and lightweight work surface that is also aesthetically pleasing.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [10]
>>
