466 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 103 0 R
/T (This project successfully achieved its primary objective of designing and fabricating a functional, lightweight, and affordable foldable laptop table using WPVC material. The fabrication process demonstrated the excellent machinability of WPVC, and the final product validated its suitability for this application. The table met all the design objectives: it is lightweight, easy to fold and unfold, compact for storage, and cost-effective. Testing confirmed its stability and load- bearing capacity for its intended use. The project highlights the potential of WPVC as a superior alternative to traditional materials like wood and MDF for lightweight furniture applications. With the proposed future improvements, this design can be further enhanced to become an even more versatile and user- friendly product.)
/E (This project successfully achieved its primary objective of designing and fabricating a functional, lightweight, and affordable foldable laptop table using WPVC material. The fabrication process demonstrated the excellent machinability of WPVC, and the final product validated its suitability for this application. The table met all the design objectives: it is lightweight, easy to fold and unfold, compact for storage, and cost-effective. Testing confirmed its stability and load- bearing capacity for its intended use. The project highlights the potential of WPVC as a superior alternative to traditional materials like wood and MDF for lightweight furniture applications. With the proposed future improvements, this design can be further enhanced to become an even more versatile and user- friendly product.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
