1185 0 obj
<<
/Title (The initial idea was to create a simple, flat surface on legs. The final design features a single-piece WPVC tabletop and two independently folding leg panels. Each leg panel is a rectangular frame cut from the same WPVC sheet, connected to the underside of the tabletop via hinges. This simple design ensures durability and ease of use. The corners of the tabletop are rounded for safety and aesthetics.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1179 0 R
/Prev 1184 0 R
>>
